sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Fr as Frontier
    participant Sch as Politeness scheduler
    participant W as Fetcher
    participant Site as Website
    participant Ex as Parser
    participant Seen as Seen set
    Fr->>Sch: next URLs
    Sch->>Sch: one queue per host, rate-limited
    Note over Sch: politeness is per host — bursting one site gets you blocked
    Sch->>W: a URL whose host is due
    W->>Site: fetch, honouring robots.txt
    Site-->>W: content
    W->>Ex: extract links and content
    Ex->>Seen: have we seen this URL or this content hash?
    alt new
        Seen->>Fr: enqueue with a priority
    else duplicate
        Seen-->>Ex: drop
    end
